{"type":"text","timestamp":1790355726723,"sessionID":"ses_f2680024fffeI2EWxSdo4s5Di9","part":{"id":"prt_0d984617a001PTVRguTSg3HMBJ","messageID":"msg_0d983e0ce001q4LGUS6oeKPiPy","sessionID":"ses_f2680024fffeI2EWxSdo4s5Di9","type":"text","text":"The camera is now a direct `Camera2D` child centered at `(320, 200)`, with its script preserving that center through the camera offset while the required `position.x = displacement` line drives the spring. I’m aligning `shake()` so it injects signed velocity, which lets the spring-damper update displacement every physics frame and naturally return to center.","time":{"start":1790355726714,"end":1790355726717},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_03d68d50b0a1946c016ab6a907ee7087d18d150e7c2639fb8f","phase":"commentary"}}}}
